{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE-HANDEDLY DEFEAT YOUR FRIENDS</h2>With a single button, you control multiple characters and all their actions. Yet it can be learned within seconds. This makes it the ideal party game to play on a big screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" width=628 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHOSE BLOOD IS THAT?</h2>Hack, smash and blast through rows of enemies! Missing a leg? It's but a flesh wound! <br>Chop until you drop!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/d2797c141c6706d8592c31ea57a4d18e.avif?t=1695111607\" width=628 height=106 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTERY</h2>Time your spins, rolls and attacks right to chop off limbs and be victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OLD SCHOOL COUCH GAMING</h2>Play through the co-op campaign to unlock new characters, arenas and factions; duel it out with 2-4 players in the arena mode or play a knock out tournament with unlimited participants!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" width=628 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE, DISCOVER, ENCOUNTER</h2>Travel across mountains and forests, swamps and settlements. Meet the locals - and wipe them out!<br><br>Some of them will join you on your conquest against evil.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/28a2653c7c0fb59f1919e0806ca132fc.avif?t=1695111607\" width=628 height=200 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/869710?t=1695111607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1695111607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1695111607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1695111607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"- Cartoon violence (characters can lose body parts)\r\n- Pixel blood"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE-HANDEDLY DEFEAT YOUR FRIENDS</h2>With a single button, you control multiple characters and all their actions. Yet it can be learned within seconds. This makes it the ideal party game to play on a big screen.<br><b